// parse_label's tail: it already spends its 3-action budget reading the
// label name and advancing twice, leaving no room to name the newleaf()
// call it must return. more/ has no room for a sibling file, so misc.id
// was promoted into this directory to make room.

label_close(int[] pos, string name) {
  advance(pos);
  int id = newleaf("label", 0, 0, name, "");
} return int id;
